  + exact new Phase3 profile constant
  + exact new topology forms and receipt profile constants with unchanged scanner profile
  + exact snake_case serialization for both new enum variants
  + old quiescent_double_inventory token rejection
  + strict receipt round-trip with consistency_evidence non_atomic_repeated_inventory_equal
  + old receipt profile rejection
  + old consistency field rejection
  + missing new field rejection
  + simultaneous old and new field rejection
  + OsSnapshotProven receipt rejection at exact field and fault code
  + preservation of every preexisting receipt invariant and negative case
  + static absence of ConsistencyClass and QuiescentDoubleInventory in production Rust
  + static absence of compatibility aliases, default, conversion, effects, dependency growth, and physical vocabulary upgrade
  + debug and overflow-checked release tests
  + complete workspace regression, format, warnings-denied lint, release build, warnings-denied docs, dependency audit, recursive evidence, and clean Git proof

